WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.689
In tutorial 4.3, you'll find out
if a keyword is worth a page,

00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:12.332
before you spend time on it.

00:00:13.353 --> 00:00:16.513
First, start Keyword verdict
from Run an analysis.

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:20.477
You'll get Go, Go with changes,
or Avoid, with the reasons.

00:00:21.486 --> 00:00:25.036
Now type one search phrase,
the way a buyer would type it.

00:00:25.086 --> 00:00:27.526
Then check the country
where your buyers search.

00:00:29.011 --> 00:00:31.461
Next, add what you sell and to whom,

00:00:31.511 --> 00:00:34.686
so the verdict judges fit
as well as competition.

00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:37.693
Or leave it empty to use
your website's description.

00:00:38.652 --> 00:00:41.052
The Summary shows the
credits and the time.

00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:43.249
When you're ready, click Get the verdict.

00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:50.313
Your verdict comes first, with an opportunity
score and the kind of page to write.

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:56.427
Below, you see how often people
search for it, how hard it is,

00:00:56.477 --> 00:00:58.038
and what kind of search it is.

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:04.770
Why lists the reasons a page can win.
And Risks lists what could hold it back.

00:01:07.177 --> 00:01:09.852
You also get the search
trend over the last year,

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.453
and related searches
the page should answer.

00:01:14.702 --> 00:01:18.752
Download it as a PDF or Word
file. And when it's a Go,

00:01:18.802 --> 00:01:21.660
click Write this page to have
the page written for you.

00:01:23.198 --> 00:01:26.333
So, type the keyword, add what
you sell, get the verdict,

00:01:26.383 --> 00:01:28.214
and read the reasons and risks.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:35.944
Now you know if it's worth it. Next, write
a page for a keyword, in tutorial 4.4.
